@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

autonumber

Admin -> App : Start the thesession.org import
App -> App : Download tunes.csv, aliases.csv and recordings.csv at run time (nothing stored in git)
App -> App : Create or update Tunes by thesession.org id\n(first setting only, aliases, composer)
App -> App : Create Albums with unclassified Artists and catalogue Tracks\n(no audio; Performances unresolved when the tune is unidentified)
App -> App : Give a Track a Set only when all its Performances are resolved
return Import report (created, updated, unresolved)
Admin -> App : Run it again later with a newer dump (idempotent, adds or updates only)

Bob -> App : Mark an imported Artist as a Band or a Musician
Bob -> App : Add Musicians to a Band
@enduml
